      "style": 82,
      "name": "Yeah. Somehow..."
    },
    {
      "$id": 4,
      "label": "bf05420100_0040",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "So it was you after all..."
    },
    {
      "$id": 5,
      "label": "bf05420100_0050",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Shin."
    },
    {
      "$id": 6,
      "label": "bf05420100_0060",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "I knew it."
    },
    {
      "$id": 7,
      "label": "bf05420100_0070",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "You're Shin, leader of Iira, correct?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 8,
      "label": "bf05420100_0080",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "I, Fan la Norne,"
    },
    {
      "$id": 9,
      "label": "bf05420100_0090",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "in the name of Pope Malbeni of Acedia,\nwill take you into custody."
    },
    {
      "$id": 10,
      "label": "bf05420100_0100",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "How pitiful. Not even knowing who you are,\nspeaking that man's name in that form."
    },
    {
      "$id": 11,
      "label": "bf05420100_0110",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "You know me...?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 12,
      "label": "bf05420100_0120",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Heaven's Holy Grail, why do you look so calm?\nDon't think this has nothing to do with you."
    },
    {
      "$id": 13,
      "label": "bf05420100_0130",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "I see. Then tell me."
    },
    {
      "$id": 14,
      "label": "bf05420100_0140",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Why are you, who fought alongside us to\ndefeat Metsu, now standing by his side?"
    },
    {
      "$id": 15,
      "label": "bf05420100_0150",
      "style": 82,
      "name": "Shin...fought alongside you?"
